    zhFact: "云栖大会相关报道显示，阿里千问 AI 平台把模型服务、Agent 服务和 AI 应用放进同一次产品升级，配套出现 API 优速模式、Agent Studio、千问 AI 座舱和企业级 RAG/多模态知识库入口。官方百炼页面同时展示 Agent 工具链与 Qwen 模型服务，但完整 API、价格和地区矩阵仍需文档核对。",
    enFact: "Coverage of Alibaba's Yunqi Conference describes a Qwen platform upgrade across model services, agent services, and AI applications, with API Fast Mode, Agent Studio, a Qwen cockpit solution, and enterprise RAG/multimodal knowledge-base entry points. Alibaba Cloud's Bailian page exposes model services and agent tooling, while the complete API, pricing, and region matrix still needs documentation verification.",
    zhValue: "这条中国 lane 的产品信号不是又一个模型发布，而是把企业从“选模型、按 token 调用”推到“编排 Agent、连接工具、交付行业应用”的同一平台。Agent Studio 和知识库入口降低了从试验到部署的切换成本，千问 AI 座舱则把 Agent 作为具体业务系统。它解决的是模型能力与生产工作流之间的断层，也让权限、数据隔离、成本和供应商锁定更集中。",
    enValue: "The China-lane signal is not another model release. It puts model selection, token calls, agent orchestration, tool connection, and industry application delivery on one platform. Agent Studio and knowledge-base entry points reduce the jump from experiment to deployment, while the Qwen cockpit frames an agent as a business system. That targets the gap between model capability and production workflow, while concentrating permission, data isolation, cost, and vendor-lock-in questions.",
